"P1032503064" "From the  evidence you've gathered, it looks like Jennifer Dietrich's auction house has been fencing stolen artifacts for the Outcasts. It also appears that Dietrich planned to double-cross the Outcasts by leaving the country with a large chunk of the profits."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P523612107" "I just got word that the Outcasts have taken some hostages at an auction house over in Steel Canyon. There's a police negotiator on site, but the Outcasts are threatening to hurt hostages if any more officers show up. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need someone to rescue those auction house workers, and I think that someone is you.</A> The Outcasts have been known to react better to heroes than to police. You only have 90 minutes to defuse the situation."
// AcceptString :
"P1451939952" "Rescue the auction house workers"
// SendOffString :
"P4194321170" "The leader of these Outcasts goes by the name {BOSS_NAME}. I need you to take him into custody."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1931936059" "Arrest {BOSS_NAME} and his crew"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4075075930" "That hostage situation needs to be defused before it descends into violence!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
