// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3214848562" "It's too bad you weren't able to stop them. The Outcasts have been putting a lot of these magic items out on the streets lately. They always seem to have a downside or a curse on them, but the Outcasts still seem to find ready buyers. I guess there are a lot of people in this city who are desperate for a little power. We can only hope that those items don't cause too much trouble."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL3_Outcasts_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Artifact 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3490587563" "Talisman of Jiang Li"
// DetailString :
"P1918814840" "This evil talisman could easily be mistaken for a simple black pebble, were it not for the fact that it burns your hand."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2239724155" "We've got a problem, {HeroName}. According to the mystics over at MAGI, the Outcasts recently got their hands on the Talisman of Jiang Li. It's a powerful artifact that gives the bearer the power to incinerate those with righteous souls. I can't think of anyone more righteous than the heroes of Paragon City! If the Outcasts figure out how to use that talisman, every hero could be in danger! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to recover the Talisman of Jiang Li!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P402606073" "Recover the Talisman of Jiang Li"
// SendOffString :
"P4147817947" "Try seeking the talisman in Boomtown or Steel Canyon. Those are the zones where the Outcasts usually hang out."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P766003034" "Recover Talisman of Jiang Li"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3370910799" "Have you found that talisman yet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1880322771" "On one of the fallen Outcasts, you found the Talisman of Jiang Li."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3288000768" "Thanks for recovering this talisman, {HeroName}. If you hadn't acted quickly, the Outcasts might have figured out how to use it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL3_Outcasts_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1967959542" "The Outcasts have claimed Steel Canyon as their territory, and are terrorizing the streets. It's going to take constant heroic action to keep them from cementing their hold on the entire zone. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a hero who can get to Steel Canyon and show them that the streets don't belong to them.</a>."
// AcceptString :
"P2528563557" "Defeat Outcasts in Steel Canyon"
// SendOffString :
"P1670711446" "The Outcasts don't just think they're above the law, they think that they can make the laws now. If you can defeat about 20 of them, it should help to knock their egos down some. Good luck, {HeroName}."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2836539761" "Go to Steel Canyon and defeat Outcasts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3575748368" "You have defeated out enough Outcasts to get your message through."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P471394556" "Great job dealing with those Outcasts, {HeroName}. They're going to be a problem in Steel Canyon for a long time, but you've taught them a lesson today."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL3_Outcasts_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3669411212" "I guess you've heard that many of the Outcasts long for the life of a superhero. Well, in Boomtown, they've started acting out their fantasies. I've heard reports of Outcasts harassing civilians for small crimes such as littering, jaywalking, and riding bikes on the sidewalk. Nobody likes a jaywalker, but this is just too much! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to get over to Boomtown and stop the Outcasts from harassing the populace.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2206135211" "Go to Boomtown and stop the Outcasts from harassing the populace"
// SendOffString :
"P3873427237" "I'm hearing the most reports from Grenadier and the Cannonade. You should probably start in those neighborhoods."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1444822661" "Combat Outcasts in Boomtown"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3659885098" "Somebody needs to show the Outcasts that they aren't the law in Boomtown."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1440113408" "You have discouraged the Outcasts from harassing the civilians in Boomtown."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P114587127" "With their powers, many of the Outcasts could have found work as heroes. It's a pity that they chose a life of crime instead."
